{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44797","headline":"题天长阮少府湖上客归 · 法振","name":"题天长阮少府湖上客归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤櫂移官舍，新农寄楚田。\n晴林渡海日，春草长湖烟。\n卧对闲鸥戏，谈经稚子贤。\n佳期更何许，应向啸台前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"法振","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44797.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44797","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}